{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d8237273c2a51cd16722c48515e7a864e049e3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{x}= c^{q}= b$\" width=\"89\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd1748ce29e7746fc2285c4a62f8a43e2371516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{y}= a^{z}= d$\" width=\"91\" height=\"12\" />, then\n</p><p>$ \\textbf{(A)}\\ xy = qz\\\\\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Try solving both equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Taking the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-th root of both sides in the first equation and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />-the root of both sides in the second gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/0/350eb9ff7af69736897430d5b8e30163329262e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c^{\\frac{q}x}$\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccf2c0078181a8f1725da28b63979fbd48738b1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c^{\\frac{y}z}$\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />.\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50ea6d035ce35d2e2f5f6b61859b24a364d60c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{q}x=\\frac{y}z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"50\" height=\"33\" />. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd70347c7940f63ff9417e383548564fd92aff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f3133cfd6673c71f5ade611e5a7446dc4ff0cff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$qz=xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"11\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&a